ADDITION 4 — EFFICACY CHECK: cot_step_prob drop per mode
  ep0_csp  = log-prob of target text after epoch 1 of unlearning
  best_csp = log-prob at the epoch with max FF-SOFT drop
  drop     = ep0_csp - best_csp  (positive -> prob decreases over epochs)
================================================================================
Mode                      |    N |   ep0 mean |  best mean |  drop mean
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Whole Block               |   15 |    -0.3829 |    -2.1680 |    +1.7850
Premise Only              |   15 |    -0.3569 |    -2.0603 |    +1.7034
Reasoning Only            |   15 |    -0.3499 |    -1.8754 |    +1.5255
Premise + Reasoning       |   15 |    -0.3569 |    -1.8785 |    +1.5216

Note: cot_step_prob is log-probability (negative). drop > 0 means model
further reduces target-text probability beyond epoch 1.

Interpretation:
  reasoning_only drop (1.5255) < whole_block (1.7850):
  unlearning is less complete on the shorter target; mode differences in
  FF-SOFT may partly reflect weaker unlearning, not faithfulness signal.

